+/**
+ * @tc.number    : HksAesKeyMt.HksAesKeyMt00100
+ * @tc.name      : HksAesKeyMt00100
+ * @tc.desc      : Huks generates aes128 bit key, which can be successfully used for OpenSSL encryption/decryption using
